name: Generate partial context with approval, explicit Map review, local scans and restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_partial_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | study
keys: Home Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | choose-context
keys: g
require-live-snap: 25 GENERATE STUDY CONTEXT | generate-context
keys: t
type: 1
keys: Enter r
type: 0
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 35 Draft ready | fixed-context-job
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_partial_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: Enter End
require-live-snap: 25 y approve | exact-generation-terms
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Open approved context job | approved-context
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_partial_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART approved
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 L starts the approved jobs | explicit-launch
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | generation-started
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_partial_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART generated
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 failed | partial-job-recorded
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | partial-generated-result
expect: Labeled generated partial source context
expect: Inspect partial context
expect: Recorded grounding: partial.
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.3
live-snap: result-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait: 0.3
live-snap: result-96x89
resize: 80x24
wait: 0.3
live-snap: result-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait: 0.3
live-snap: result-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.3
live-snap: result-40x12
expect: Inspect partial context
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_partial_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART result-limit-page
live-snap: result-limit-40x12
resize: 120x36
wait: 0.3
keys: Home
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | exact-partial-revision
expect: Recorded grounding: partial.
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.3
live-snap: context-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait: 0.3
live-snap: context-96x89
resize: 80x24
wait: 0.3
live-snap: context-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait: 0.3
live-snap: context-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.3
live-snap: context-40x12
keys: NPage NPage
wait: 0.3
live-snap: context-detail-40x12
ask: Does generated context make its partial grounding, exact saved revision, inspection limit and separate Map acceptance understandable across all six sizes?
resize: 120x36
wait: 0.3
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | result-return
keys: m
require-live-snap: 30 Recorded Map is ready for review | recorded-partial-map
keys: m
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT partial | map-needs-acknowledgment
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_partial_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART mapped
nav-mode:
require-live-snap: 25 Acknowledge & use partial | partial-action
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 15 Use partial | partial-map-40x12
keys: o
require-live-snap: 25 REPLAY | result-reader
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_partial_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART limit-page
live-snap: partial-limit-40x12
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT partial | unresolved-map-return
resize: 120x36
wait: 0.3
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-partial-context
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_partial_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART accepted
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks semgrep
paste-file: @ART/rule-setting.txt
keys: Enter
submit: set semgrepTimeoutMs 60000
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | source-map
nav-mode:
keys: Tab z
require-live-snap: 25 s plan scan | scoped-diagram
expect: files
expect: "app.py"
keys: s
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | exact-source-study
expect: 1 exact source path
keys: Home Down Down Down Down Down Enter
type: 1
keys: Enter Down Enter
type: 0
keys: Enter L
require-live-snap: 35 Draft ready | fixed-local-jobs
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_partial_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART scan-draft
keys: L End
require-live-snap: 25 y approve | local-work-terms
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved-local-work
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | scan-launch-separate
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | local-scans-started
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_partial_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART scanned
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 3 completed | fixed-local-work-finished
keys: q
require-live-snap: 25 s plan scan | source-origin
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Scan | scan-result
nav-mode:
keys: n
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | observations
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 Owned policy marker needs an owner decision | policy-finding
submit: decision deferred Owned static policy needs an owner decision
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Context grounding: partial. | partial-context-report
expect: 1 committed / 1 calls
expect: Evidence: 3 producer observations
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 25 format json (4/6) | json-export
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | faithful-export
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_partial_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
ask: Does Report preserve the generated partial context, one consumed context request, three approved source-only observations and an independent human deferral without claiming complete coverage?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Context grounding: partial. | recovered-report
expect: 1 committed / 1 calls
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_partial_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the exact accepted context, shared spending, observations and owner decision without another request or scan?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
